config FON_TDM
	tristate "FRITZ!Box 7530 FON TDM transport (diagnostic)"
	depends on OF
	depends on ARCH_QCOM || COMPILE_TEST
	help
	  Minimal, diagnostic-only transport driver for the analog FON
	  interface of the FRITZ!Box 7530 (IPQ4019 + QCA ADSS/MBOX/TDM).

	  This driver prepares the TX/RX TDM/MBOX DMA rings and exposes
	  read-only diagnostic state.  It does not start DMA, drive ring
	  voltage, or implement ALSA/DAHDI/CAPI.  Hardware writes and DMA
	  start are disabled by default and require explicit module
	  parameters and a separate validation step.

	  Say M to build the module.  A device-tree node using
	  compatible = "avm,fon-tdm" is required.
